  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TTMF&#x2013;IDB Invest Housing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project consists of a guarantee for up to TTD 203 million Trinidadian dollars (&#x201c;TTD&#x201d;), equivalent to US$30 million, to support a TTD670 million bond issuance by TTMF. TTMF provides residential mortgages to buy houses, land, home improvement, and home equity. The IDB Invest&#x2019;s role will be to issue a Partial Credit Guarantee (&#x201c;PCG&#x201d;), for 30%-50% of the total bond issuance, with the goal of improving the rating profile for the TTMF bond. The bond will have a five-year tenor.TTMF focuses on providing affordable residential mortgage financing in Trinidad and Tobago. As a not deposit taking institution, TTMF relies primarily on bonds to fund its lending operations. The proposed project will be approved under the following delegated facility: &#x201c;Debt Capital Markets Program.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
